摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"CloudQ integration for DeepSeek Harness. It adds a CloudQ mode to the Web profile, bundles the cloudq skill, and provides CloudQ usage and architecture views, local credential setup, and plugin management.","id":"gh:1349278800","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"cloudq-for-dsh","slug":"TencentCloud/cloudq-for-dsh","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"CloudQ integration for DeepSeek Harness. It adds a CloudQ mode to the Web profile, bundles the cloud"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"q skill, and provides CloudQ usage and architecture views, local credential setup, and plugin manage"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ll, and provides CloudQ usage and architecture views, local credential setup, and plugin management."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-cloudq"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"CloudQ integration for DeepSeek Harness. It adds a CloudQ mode to the Web profile, bundles the `clou"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"dq` skill, and provides CloudQ usage and architecture views, local credential setup, and plugin mana"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ll, and provides CloudQ usage and architecture views, local credential setup, and plugin management."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Node.js `>=22.19.0`\n- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2` or a compatible newer `0.1.x` release\n- `pnpm`"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" available to the `dsh plugin` command\n- macOS, Linux, or Windows\n- Optional: the CloudQ conversatio"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"n mode is driven by the bundled skill and needs Python 3 available as `python3`; the settings, usage"},{"id":"p7s4","text":", inspiration, artifact, and architecture panels do not require Python"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart the Web profile after installation:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Open the URL printed by DSH. The conversation input area and sidebar will expose the CloudQ entry. Y"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ou can also invoke the bundled skill explicitly with `/cloudq`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Upgrade and remove"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart the Web profile after changing the installed package set."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → Plugins** and expand the **CloudQ** card.\n2. Enter your Tencent Cloud `SecretId"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"` and `SecretKey` (available from the CAM console).\n3. Click **测试连接** to validate the pair, then **保"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"存配置**. The card shows **AKSK有效** once the credential is active.\n4. Click **进入 CloudQ 模式** in the con"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"versation input area — or type `/cloudq` — and start asking cloud operations questions, e.g. “帮我看看系统"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"on input area — or type `/cloudq` — and start asking cloud operations questions, e.g. “帮我看看系统有哪些风险”."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Credentials"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The settings card accepts a Tencent Cloud `SecretId`/`SecretKey` pair."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Credentials are stored locally at `~/.tencent-cloudq/credential.json` with owner-only permissions."},{"id":"p22s2","text":"\n- Panel APIs sign and call Tencent Cloud in-process (native Node implementation); secrets never pas"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"s through any subprocess or appear in process lists.\n- Browser APIs return only credential state and"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" masked identifiers; local credential paths and secret values are not returned.\n- Use the logout act"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ion to remove the stored credential."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Follow least-privilege: grant only the permissions required for the CloudQ operations you intend to "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"run. The bundled skill can invoke read and write cloud-management operations; review each action bef"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"skill can invoke read and write cloud-management operations; review each action before approving it."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Host APIs accept only loopback, same-origin requests.\n- JSON request bodies are limited to 64 KiB."},{"id":"p25s2","text":"\n- Unexpected internal errors are not returned to the browser.\n- Remote values are inserted with DOM"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" text nodes rather than HTML injection.\n- Download links require HTTPS.\n- No credentials, tokens, or"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" local environment files are included in the npm package."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Report security issues through GitHub Issues without including live credentials."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Can't install or update to the latest version? (24-hour supply-chain cooling period)**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"pnpm 11 only installs versions that have been published for at least 24 hours. Right after a release"},{"id":"p29s2","text":", pin the version explicitly:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"or wait for the cooldown to expire and the bare command will resolve to the newest release."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Does it work on Windows? Do I need Python?**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Yes. The settings, usage, inspiration, artifact, and architecture panels are a native Node implement"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ation and need **no Python** on any of macOS / Linux / Windows. Only **CloudQ conversation mode** is"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" driven by the bundled skill and requires `python3`."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Where is my AK/SK stored? Is it safe?**"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"At `~/.tencent-cloudq/credential.json` (owner-only permissions). Panel APIs sign in-process; credent"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ials never pass through a subprocess or appear in process lists. The **退出登录** action removes it."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**Why does 测试连接 fail?**"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"On 0.3.0+ the panels no longer depend on Python. If it still fails, make sure the key belongs to the"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" current account and that Smart Advisor (CloudQ) is enabled for it."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The npm package ships prebuilt Host and Web client artifacts, the bundle patch, the runtime logo, an"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"d the bundled skill. Registry installation runs no build scripts."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Release"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Source is reviewed and versioned in TencentCloud/cloudq-for-dsh. An npm version is published to the "},{"id":"p44s2","text":"official registry only after the repository checks and the package-install smoke test pass."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## More documentation"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"- Changelog: `CHANGELOG.md`\n- Development & maintenance guide: `DEVELOPMENT.md`"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"MIT. See `LICENSE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
